Module : Smart Text Formatting & Alignment
To ensure perfect legibility across all custom grid styles, the tool will feature an automated typography engine. This system dynamically recalculates font properties whenever the user alters the grid shape, cell size, or border thickness.

Dynamic Font Scaling: The engine mathematically determines the maximum legible font size based on the specific interior area of the chosen shape. For example, text within a standard square requires different scaling than text restricted by the angled walls of a diamond. The engine scales seamlessly whether the layout is a 40 by 50 grid with 4.38 mm cells or a denser 50 by 65 grid utilizing tighter 3.5 mm cells on an 8.5 by 11-inch canvas.

